    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-05T21:17:44+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-05T21:17:44+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-05T10:47:44Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-05T10:47:44Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system in the Bight extends a ridge over SA. The high moves through the Bight and over the eastern states, as a cold front clips the southeast on Friday. Another high pressure system moves over waters to the south of SA over the weekend, while a developing low pressure system and trough in WA move close to the SA border. The high drifts southeast of Australia as the low moves across SA on Monday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW009" description="Flinders" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-11-05T21:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-06T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-05T10:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-05T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Clear. Winds south to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-06T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-07T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-05T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-06T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Winds northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending west to northwesterly 15 to 25 km/h in the morning then turning south to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h in the late morning and early afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 8 and 13 with daytime temperatures reaching around 30.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">Moderate</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:00am to 5:00pm, UV Index predicted to reach 11 [Extreme]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-07T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-08T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-06T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-07T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Winds southerly 20 to 30 km/h turning southeasterly 25 to 35 km/h in the early morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 9 and 14 with daytime temperatures reaching 22 to 29.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-08T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-09T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-07T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-08T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Winds easterly 25 to 40 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 5 and 13 with daytime temperatures reaching 23 to 29.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-09T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-10T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-08T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-09T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers, most likely in the morning and afternoon. The chance of a thunderstorm in the afternoon and evening. Winds east to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 10 and 17 with daytime temperatures reaching 27 to 34.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
